<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14588" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπύρετος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>free from fever,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				4.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Philops.</u>
				25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1582.9
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>; <i>not inducing fever,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίαιτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					69
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					226.6
				</span></i>
			; <i>relieving fever,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντίδοτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archig.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.173
			</span></i>:— perh. to be read for <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπύρευτος</span></b> 
			f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				3.6
			</span></i>.</div>
